OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's death ruled preventable by
OL,4,Acoroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman's death at the Royal Victoria
OL,7,FHospital (RVH) in 2019 has been ruled
OL,8,Fpreventable by a coroner in Belfast.
OL,10,FLillian Diamond was 60 when she
OL,11,Funderwent an elective splenectomy
OL,12,Fsurgery at the Mater Hospital. She died
OL,13,Fweeks later.
OL,15,FCoroner Anne-Louise Toal told her
OL,16,Ffamily at Laganside Court in Belfast
OL,17,Fthat Diamond's death was "on balance of
OL,18,Fprobabilities preventable" but she
OL,19,Fnoted that there has been "significant
OL,20,Flearning" and "cultural change" since
OL,21,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
